WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
I think it was when we saw it really

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:06.600
working in the field without any sort of support.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.220
And what I mean by that is we were

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.420
able to do exactly the same as we did

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:14.340
before report wise, but we were able to do

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.480
it quicker and we were able to do it

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.460
slicker.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.680
So what I mean by that is that we

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.900
had the ability to actually generate a high quality

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.120
report that needed very minimal admin or tidying up

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:27.680
afterwards.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.420
And we were then able to bounce from that

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.950
job to the next job.

